1
00:00:37,843 --> 00:00:39,311
Hey, what's up?

2
00:00:39,311 --> 00:00:41,803
Show me something that I can
buy for bottom drawers.

3
00:00:41,803 --> 00:00:43,872
- Is your daughter getting married?
- Yeah.

4
00:00:43,872 --> 00:00:47,013
- Her father-in-law is a doctor.
- She's got a rich husband.

5
00:00:50,936 --> 00:00:54,536
If you don't like this, I can show you
some dishes that are from France.

6
00:00:54,536 --> 00:00:58,498
Her parents-in-law live very simply.

7
00:00:59,395 --> 00:01:00,991
She's so lucky.

8
00:01:00,991 --> 00:01:05,820
Many couples develop troubles because
of their bottom drawers.

9
00:01:05,820 --> 00:01:11,445
Some of them even came here
to get a refund.

10
00:01:11,445 --> 00:01:14,762
That's not going to happen to us.
Just show me the best one you got.

11
00:01:15,821 --> 00:01:20,810
I'm jealous. I wish my kids could have
nice parents-in-law like your daughter does.

12
00:01:22,085 --> 00:01:24,057
Look at this one.

13
00:01:27,506 --> 00:01:30,311
- What's all that?
- It's Hae Yoon's bottom drawers.

14
00:01:31,659 --> 00:01:35,309
- I want to see them.
- It's hard to wrap like that.

15
00:01:35,309 --> 00:01:37,111
- What's this?
- It's a dinner set.

16
00:01:37,111 --> 00:01:39,312
- Then what about this?
- Sets of silver spoons and chopsticks.

17
00:01:39,312 --> 00:01:40,371
Is that all?

18
00:01:40,371 --> 00:01:43,676
I have to do the duvet bedding.
I need to know the bed size first.

19
00:01:44,386 --> 00:01:49,550
He still didn't call us. Call him
and tell him to come home soon.

20
00:01:49,550 --> 00:01:51,520
Okay.

21
00:01:54,574 --> 00:01:58,294
- It's Hae Yoon's mom.
- Get it.

22
00:02:01,419 --> 00:02:03,070
Hello.

23
00:02:03,070 --> 00:02:05,504
- Hi, it's me.
- Hi.

24
00:02:05,504 --> 00:02:10,751
I could've asked Hae Yoon to call you but
I did it because we're close enough now.

25
00:02:10,751 --> 00:02:12,839
What did you want to ask me?

26
00:02:12,839 --> 00:02:14,790
What's your bed size?

27
00:02:14,790 --> 00:02:20,644
I'm shopping for the bottom drawers now.
I want to do something practical.

28
00:02:20,644 --> 00:02:22,769
I'm thinking of buying a duvet bedding.

29
00:02:22,769 --> 00:02:27,823
I guess you haven't heard about it yet.
I think you need to talk to her first.

30
00:02:27,823 --> 00:02:31,313
Why do I have to talk to her about your bed size?

31
00:02:31,313 --> 00:02:34,139
They broke up.

32
00:02:35,742 --> 00:02:38,504
Who said that?
Did Jung Hoon say that?

33
00:02:38,504 --> 00:02:43,625
No. Hae Yoon did. She came to look around
her marital home and told us that.

34
00:02:43,625 --> 00:02:46,000
It's so absurd.

35
00:02:46,434 --> 00:02:49,123
Absurd? I think so too...

36
00:02:49,123 --> 00:02:51,713
What the heck? Did she hang up?

37
00:02:51,713 --> 00:02:55,724
- What's going on?
- What happened?

38
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:58,753
I think this woman caused another problem.

39
00:02:58,753 --> 00:03:03,370
No wonder she said she
would pay for the interior.

40
00:03:03,370 --> 00:03:04,811
Didn't Mrs. Jung know about this?

41
00:03:04,811 --> 00:03:07,344
Don't call her that.
She's just Hae Yoon's mom now.

42
00:03:07,344 --> 00:03:09,853
Don't be so cranky.

43
00:03:09,853 --> 00:03:13,635
She's a parent too. She must
be as shocked as us.

44
00:03:14,573 --> 00:03:16,615
Now, Jung Hoon is the problem.

45
00:03:16,615 --> 00:03:20,960
He had so many difficulties after he broke
up with Hae Yoon last time, right?

46
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,414
He kept drinking.

47
00:03:26,592 --> 00:03:28,481
What makes you so sure about me?

48
00:03:29,193 --> 00:03:32,005
You don't believe I don't love you anymore, do you?

49
00:03:32,005 --> 00:03:33,788
No, I don't.

50
00:03:33,788 --> 00:03:39,920
- How can you not love me?
- Because I fell in love with somebody else.

51
00:03:46,848 --> 00:03:48,726
I can tell you just made that up.

52
00:03:49,779 --> 00:03:57,720
Now I realized why I was attracted
to an orphan and dated one for 5 years.

53
00:03:57,720 --> 00:04:02,458
It was because of the sense of kinship that
comes from having the same background.

54
00:04:03,291 --> 00:04:06,344
Did you change your mind because
I'm the daughter of a rich family?

55
00:04:07,153 --> 00:04:09,569
This is why I didn't tell
you about my background.

56
00:04:09,569 --> 00:04:12,127
I think you have more serious
problems than I do. It's like trauma.

57
00:04:12,127 --> 00:04:13,984
You know what causes that?

58
00:04:13,984 --> 00:04:17,834
The background I'm talking
about is a wound.

59
00:04:17,834 --> 00:04:20,117
A wound from parents.

60
00:04:20,916 --> 00:04:27,557
Do you know? Do you know how it feels
to be rejected by someone you love?

61
00:04:27,557 --> 00:04:34,268
Do you know how scary it is to love
somebody or to be loved by somebody?

62
00:04:35,258 --> 00:04:40,320
I don't know how scary it is to love
somebody or to be loved by somebody.

63
00:04:42,249 --> 00:04:45,294
- What an evil bastard.
- You're an evil bastard.

64
00:04:45,294 --> 00:04:48,691
Just admit it.
I didn't lie to you at least.

65
00:04:48,691 --> 00:04:53,300
But you lied to yourself and to people around you.

66
00:04:59,064 --> 00:05:04,857
Look over my project proposal.
You know what I want to achieve.

67
00:05:04,857 --> 00:05:09,220
I know and that's why I don't
want to give you what you want.

68
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:13,769
I like that attitude. Do what
you want to do, like this.

69
00:05:13,769 --> 00:05:17,557
Don't try to be innocent
wearing a sheep mask.

70
00:05:17,557 --> 00:05:21,409
You really are confident about me.

71
00:05:21,905 --> 00:05:26,722
You should leave me. It's the best path for you.

72
00:05:52,950 --> 00:05:57,236
- Where are you going?
- Don't be kind. I don't like it.

73
00:05:57,591 --> 00:05:59,522
You're acting perverse.

74
00:06:00,138 --> 00:06:03,311
Let me tell you this again. I don't love you now.

75
00:06:04,224 --> 00:06:08,695
Don't be so mean to your father.
I've been there and done it.

76
00:06:13,385 --> 00:06:15,730
This is why I hate you.

77
00:06:16,874 --> 00:06:18,439
Even if I rejected it

78
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:24,787
you should've made me get in the car saying,
'you shouldn't be here alone today'.

79
00:06:29,462 --> 00:06:34,677
I'm the problem.
Always.

80
00:06:37,672 --> 00:06:42,321
I lack love and affection.

81
00:06:42,321 --> 00:06:44,455
Min Dong Bi.

82
00:06:49,384 --> 00:06:52,407
You want me to hold you, don't you?

83
00:06:56,089 --> 00:07:00,021
Do you know who I hate the most?
It's you, Gong Ki Joong!

84
00:07:00,021 --> 00:07:06,394
Do you know how much I loved you? If you'd
loved me, my life wouldn't be like this.

85
00:07:07,011 --> 00:07:10,611
- I love you.
- I love Jung Hoon.

86
00:07:11,239 --> 00:07:15,742
He came to my heart. No, he
was already in my heart.

87
00:07:23,576 --> 00:07:25,835
I don't believe that.

88
00:07:25,835 --> 00:07:29,570
Then don't. I don't love
him to make you believe.

89
00:07:31,231 --> 00:07:33,567
Does Hae Yoon know?

90
00:07:33,567 --> 00:07:36,865
- They broke up.
- They did? Because of you?

91
00:07:37,814 --> 00:07:40,095
Do I even have a strong presence to them?

92
00:07:41,346 --> 00:07:45,529
I didn't even have a presence in front of
my ex-boyfriend who I dated for 5 years.

93
00:07:47,717 --> 00:07:49,790
That's not love.

94
00:07:49,790 --> 00:07:51,845
It's a temporary confusion

95
00:07:51,845 --> 00:07:55,956
that a person who was born in a cold place
has when she goes to a warm place.

96
00:07:56,406 --> 00:08:01,327
He was with me whenever I had hard times.

97
00:08:02,836 --> 00:08:09,576
If I go to Jung Hoon's house, there's
this warm atmosphere in his house.

98
00:08:11,836 --> 00:08:15,678
I stay in my house where there's
only cold wind blowing.

99
00:08:15,678 --> 00:08:17,650
But if I go to his house, I feel happy.

100
00:08:19,443 --> 00:08:24,359
Feeling comfortable and warm isn't love?

101
00:08:28,332 --> 00:08:30,139
It is love.

102
00:08:30,139 --> 00:08:33,723
Then it's right that I love him.

103
00:08:38,038 --> 00:08:41,356
That love was what I had for you.

104
00:08:43,250 --> 00:08:50,082
You weren't next to me even once
when I wanted you.

105
00:09:00,255 --> 00:09:02,138
How do you want me to cut your hair?

106
00:09:02,138 --> 00:09:04,238
Just cut it short please.

107
00:09:23,483 --> 00:09:25,440
Will you marry me?

108
00:09:43,922 --> 00:09:46,382
Let's get married quickly.

109
00:10:03,868 --> 00:10:07,236
She's not answering my phone.
What's going on?

110
00:10:07,236 --> 00:10:10,781
She didn't break up with him for sure, right?
What if she did?

111
00:10:10,781 --> 00:10:14,496
Everybody knows that she's getting married.
All she had to do was print the invitation.

112
00:10:14,496 --> 00:10:16,591
It's not a big deal. They'll
forget about it eventually.

113
00:10:16,591 --> 00:10:20,262
So many people get a divorce.
She didn't have the wedding yet.

114
00:10:20,262 --> 00:10:25,128
Hae Jin is one of the many people. Why
are things like this happening to our family?

115
00:10:25,128 --> 00:10:26,769
Don't we have to exorcise or something?

116
00:10:26,769 --> 00:10:31,602
You must be kidding. Many things can happen.
She will endure it.

117
00:10:31,602 --> 00:10:34,597
- She can do it.
- I really respect you, sis.

118
00:10:34,597 --> 00:10:36,810
How could you live after your husband died?

119
00:10:36,810 --> 00:10:42,086
If someone I love died, I would follow him.

120
00:10:42,086 --> 00:10:46,609
Call Hae Jin and ask her if she wants
me to come with her to the court.

121
00:10:47,119 --> 00:10:48,668
You can worry about that in this situation?

122
00:10:48,834 --> 00:10:50,709
You will see if you have a kid.

123
00:10:50,709 --> 00:10:53,014
I said you didn't have to come.

124
00:10:53,014 --> 00:10:55,705
- Are you sure you don't want me to follow you?
- I'm fine.

125
00:10:55,705 --> 00:10:58,050
- Where's Do Hyun?
- He comes home late.

126
00:10:58,050 --> 00:11:01,983
It's so weird. Why did he come back?
He wants a divorce.

127
00:11:01,983 --> 00:11:04,479
I think he thinks staying home
is more favorable to him.

128
00:11:04,479 --> 00:11:07,823
Do you want me to make him leave?
If I stay here, he will leave.

129
00:11:07,823 --> 00:11:10,555
Can you do that? You're busy
preparing for Hae Yoon's wedding.

130
00:11:10,555 --> 00:11:14,418
I came to talk about her with you. I've been
calling her but she's not answering.

131
00:11:14,418 --> 00:11:19,739
Call her. I know you're having hard times
but it's good to distract yourself from it.

132
00:11:19,739 --> 00:11:22,884
- Then you can forget about it for a while.
- Okay.

133
00:11:22,884 --> 00:11:25,609
What happened to her anyway?

134
00:11:25,609 --> 00:11:29,282
I found out when I talked to Mrs. Ha on
the phone. She said they broke up.

135
00:11:29,282 --> 00:11:33,076
Why? Did his family find
out I'm getting a divorce?

136
00:11:33,076 --> 00:11:37,044
No. Her marriage has nothing
to do with your divorce.

137
00:11:37,044 --> 00:11:39,439
Don't feel small because of things like that.

138
00:11:41,903 --> 00:11:44,517
- I'm sorry.
- For what?

139
00:11:45,914 --> 00:11:49,363
I should've lived happily.
I'm not worthy of seeing you.

140
00:11:51,144 --> 00:11:54,262
I feel sorry because I think
you had this marriage because of me.

141
00:11:54,262 --> 00:11:56,665
He's a very educated man but
why is he such a douche bag.

142
00:11:56,665 --> 00:12:00,211
I thought an educated man would be
so nice to a woman but he's worse.

143
00:12:00,211 --> 00:12:03,019
My mind keeps changing 12 times in a day.

144
00:12:03,019 --> 00:12:07,691
I feel like I can win this but
then I feel like I'm going to die.

145
00:12:07,691 --> 00:12:10,941
That's how people live a life.
I've been through that too.

146
00:12:10,941 --> 00:12:12,973
Luckily you have me.

147
00:12:12,973 --> 00:12:20,055
I was left in the world with my two little
babies and young sister. I was 38 years old.

148
00:12:20,055 --> 00:12:21,800
I know.

149
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:25,211
How could you endure all these days?

150
00:12:25,211 --> 00:12:27,603
You can do it if you have to.

151
00:12:28,576 --> 00:12:33,287
Do you eat meals everyday? You shouldn't
skip meals no matter what happens.

152
00:12:53,266 --> 00:12:56,073
I still remember the look on Hae Yoon's face.

153
00:12:56,073 --> 00:12:58,944
How could she say that in front of us?

154
00:12:58,944 --> 00:13:01,478
She said she didn't want to lie to us.

155
00:13:01,478 --> 00:13:03,509
She's honest and has a lot of pride.

156
00:13:03,509 --> 00:13:05,609
I'm wondering why they broke up.

157
00:13:07,019 --> 00:13:10,640
I think it's Dong Bi. Jung Hoon
said it's not but I think it is.

158
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,753
Hae Yoon didn't let it go.

159
00:13:13,445 --> 00:13:15,776
They had a lovers' quarrel.

160
00:13:15,776 --> 00:13:17,982
If that's the case, they can
get back together, right?

161
00:13:17,982 --> 00:13:21,242
- Then we should be careful.
- What?

162
00:13:21,242 --> 00:13:24,038
I know Hae Yoon will be a
good wife to Jung Hoon.

163
00:13:24,038 --> 00:13:29,159
But look at her family. I can't let him suffer
because of her mother. I'm glad they broke up.

164
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:33,050
Don't do that. How did your
parents treat me at first?

165
00:13:33,050 --> 00:13:36,523
We were very hurt because of that.

166
00:13:36,523 --> 00:13:39,010
It's a different situation.

167
00:13:39,010 --> 00:13:41,968
My parents had some problems emotionally.

168
00:13:41,968 --> 00:13:45,644
Then do you have a problem emotionally, just like them?

169
00:13:46,191 --> 00:13:51,543
You know your own mind, that's why I wanted
to marry you and we still love each other.

170
00:13:51,543 --> 00:13:54,545
- I'm special.
- So is Hae Yoon.

171
00:13:54,545 --> 00:13:57,445
Everyone thinks they're special.

172
00:13:57,445 --> 00:14:00,109
Don't put me and Hae Yoon in the same shoes.

173
00:14:00,109 --> 00:14:04,027
Even if my parents had some problems,
they weren't like Hae Yoon's mom.

174
00:14:04,027 --> 00:14:07,672
You think that because they are your parents.
You probably don't know.

175
00:14:07,672 --> 00:14:11,740
I'm getting mad. What was
wrong with my mom and dad?

176
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:15,047
You see? You're getting mad because
I'm talking about your parents.

177
00:14:15,047 --> 00:14:21,980
We both weren't free from our parents before.
Let's not talk about other families like that.

178
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:26,123
I hate when you talk like that.
It's about our son.

179
00:14:26,123 --> 00:14:29,607
Let's not be a teacher for our son's problem.

180
00:14:35,506 --> 00:14:37,116
Thank you.

181
00:14:37,116 --> 00:14:43,050
Why aren't you answering Mom's call?
She's worried. Call her.

182
00:14:48,643 --> 00:14:50,345
It's Hae Yoon.

183
00:14:51,704 --> 00:14:55,203
- Where are you?
- I have a meeting at Gangnam.

184
00:14:55,203 --> 00:14:57,629
Is it true you broke up with Jung Hoon?

185
00:14:58,478 --> 00:15:00,916
- Yeah.
- Is it true?

186
00:15:02,847 --> 00:15:04,994
So are you crying alone somewhere?

187
00:15:04,994 --> 00:15:08,607
No. I'm not going to get drunk and cry by myself.

188
00:15:08,607 --> 00:15:10,693
Don't worry.

189
00:15:10,693 --> 00:15:12,359
Tell her to come here.

190
00:15:12,359 --> 00:15:13,798
She said she has a meeting.

191
00:15:13,798 --> 00:15:17,141
- Go home early though.
- Okay.

192
00:15:17,141 --> 00:15:19,619
You're going to the court, right? Fighting.

193
00:15:20,799 --> 00:15:23,353
Okay.
Fighting to you too.

194
00:15:24,382 --> 00:15:25,502
- Fighting for what?
- For the court tomorrow.

195
00:15:28,560 --> 00:15:30,951
She sounded okay.
She's like the same.

196
00:15:31,609 --> 00:15:34,184
- Then it's serious.
- Why?

197
00:15:34,184 --> 00:15:38,517
Don't you know her? If she cries or
something, that's the start, not the end.

198
00:15:38,517 --> 00:15:40,833
If she really wants to end,
then she does it so quietly.

199
00:15:56,934 --> 00:16:00,729
You went to the salon? You don't
have to try to look nice for me.

200
00:16:01,310 --> 00:16:03,172
You're so funny.

201
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:06,383
How did you get this?

202
00:16:06,383 --> 00:16:09,433
That's what I want to ask you.
Why did you still have this?

203
00:16:10,284 --> 00:16:14,041
I don't know. Would you like to drink after?
I know many good places.

204
00:16:14,924 --> 00:16:17,053
No. I want to go home early.
I came here to give you that.

205
00:16:18,044 --> 00:16:21,262
Hae Yoon, the best way to forget
about a man is by another man.

206
00:16:21,262 --> 00:16:23,686
After the disengagement, I met so many women.

207
00:16:24,402 --> 00:16:28,201
You don't have to find another man
somewhere else. You met your first love.

208
00:16:28,201 --> 00:16:30,111
I don't want to see another man.

209
00:16:30,516 --> 00:16:33,750
You said you won't date a man after
we broke up. But you met Jung Hoon.

210
00:16:33,750 --> 00:16:37,714
After I broke up with you, I met many guys.

211
00:16:37,714 --> 00:16:39,285
- Hey.
- Bye.

212
00:16:40,643 --> 00:16:44,346
Is she playing hard to get?
I like that.

213
00:16:44,346 --> 00:16:47,192
Hae Yoon.

214
00:16:56,634 --> 00:16:58,549
Hi, Mom.

215
00:17:00,595 --> 00:17:02,086
What are you doing?

216
00:17:02,086 --> 00:17:04,616
There weren't any side dishes so
I made some stir-fried-potato.

217
00:17:05,993 --> 00:17:09,020
You got drunk the other day because of the breakup?

218
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:11,477
It's all over. I'm not going to drink.

219
00:17:11,477 --> 00:17:14,126
- You don't want to talk about it?
- No, I don't.

220
00:17:14,126 --> 00:17:19,154
I need to know the reason though. You
convinced me so you can marry him.

221
00:17:19,154 --> 00:17:21,489
There wasn't an answer to the marriage. I
can't marry a man when I can't find an answer.

222
00:17:21,489 --> 00:17:24,176
There isn't an answer to your life.

223
00:17:25,191 --> 00:17:27,352
Did Mrs. Ha say something
about the marital house?

224
00:17:27,352 --> 00:17:30,895
No, she didn't say anything.
It's about me and Jung Hoon.

225
00:17:30,895 --> 00:17:33,364
Who broke up first? It was him again?

226
00:17:33,884 --> 00:17:36,982
- No. I did.
- You said you love him.

227
00:17:36,982 --> 00:17:39,144
You said you love him. Why did you break up?

228
00:17:39,144 --> 00:17:41,686
Do you think you're the only one
going through hard times?

229
00:17:41,686 --> 00:17:44,682
Every couple has to go through them
while preparing the wedding.

230
00:17:44,682 --> 00:17:47,210
What you said about love was right.
Love was no big deal.

231
00:17:47,210 --> 00:17:48,994
Reality is much stronger than love.

232
00:17:48,994 --> 00:17:50,644
Did you just realize that?

233
00:17:50,644 --> 00:17:53,077
I bought the bottom drawers
for your parents-in-law today.

234
00:17:53,077 --> 00:17:55,037
What should I do with those now? Huh?

235
00:17:55,037 --> 00:17:58,539
- Go return them.
- How? They were for bottom drawers.

236
00:17:58,539 --> 00:18:00,568
Then we can use them.
I'll pay you back.

237
00:18:00,568 --> 00:18:04,268
Money isn't important in this situation.
Didn't Jung Hoon stop you?

238
00:18:04,268 --> 00:18:05,970
He accepted what I said.

239
00:18:05,970 --> 00:18:08,418
What a nice man.

240
00:18:08,418 --> 00:18:12,286
He listens to people very well. He
listens to me, his mother, and you.

241
00:18:12,286 --> 00:18:15,593
- He's spineless.
- He did the best he could.

242
00:18:15,593 --> 00:18:18,333
Whatever. I'm not going to say
anything about that anymore.

243
00:18:18,333 --> 00:18:25,006
I knew Sang Jin has a crush on you but I
ignored it because I liked Jung Hoon.

244
00:18:25,006 --> 00:18:26,735
I'm glad you broke up with him.
Marry Sang Jin.

245
00:18:26,735 --> 00:18:29,604
- No.
- Why not?

246
00:18:29,604 --> 00:18:32,000
He's not spineless.

247
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,133
He's smart and likes you.

248
00:18:34,133 --> 00:18:39,425
You lied that he's married because you're
worried I'm going to hook you up with him.

249
00:18:39,425 --> 00:18:43,032
I dated him but he cheated on me.

250
00:18:43,032 --> 00:18:44,810
Do you want to live like my sister?

251
00:18:46,158 --> 00:18:49,190
Why do you talk about Hae Jin here?
What's wrong with Hae Jin?

252
00:18:49,190 --> 00:18:52,678
You will be happier to live
with him instead of Jung Hoon.

253
00:18:52,678 --> 00:18:55,863
What should I eat to make me think like you?

254
00:18:55,863 --> 00:18:57,874
You eat the same things that I eat.
Don't be silly.

255
00:18:58,767 --> 00:19:01,367
Do you think he's going to make
the same mistake he did before?

256
00:19:01,367 --> 00:19:02,495
Just date him.

257
00:19:02,495 --> 00:19:05,844
He ruined a family once,
he could do it again. Who said that?

258
00:19:05,844 --> 00:19:09,186
I did. Words can have different
meanings in different situations.

259
00:19:09,186 --> 00:19:11,141
You don't know that?

260
00:19:11,566 --> 00:19:13,632
- Do you want to eat?
- You eat.

261
00:19:14,328 --> 00:19:17,174
I'm going to pack my stuff and
stay at Hae Jin's for a while.

262
00:19:30,831 --> 00:19:32,617
What are you doing?

263
00:19:32,617 --> 00:19:35,271
I was waiting for you.
Let's go drink.

264
00:19:35,271 --> 00:19:38,425
Okay. I'm in the mood
for drinking tonight.

265
00:19:46,139 --> 00:19:47,736
Dad.

266
00:19:47,736 --> 00:19:50,409
- Hi.
- I knew you'd be here.

267
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:53,770
- What made you come here?
- I'd like to drink with my son.

268
00:19:54,470 --> 00:19:55,897
I'm okay.

269
00:19:55,897 --> 00:19:58,323
Even if you're okay, it's
good to drink on such a day.

270
00:19:58,323 --> 00:20:00,390
It'd be the best if you drink with me.

271
00:20:00,390 --> 00:20:04,683
- Did something happen?
- I'm not getting married.

272
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:08,092
- You can come with us.
- It's okay.

273
00:20:08,092 --> 00:20:10,278
Come with us. You said you
want to drink tonight.

274
00:20:10,278 --> 00:20:12,809
- It's okay.
- Come on. Let's go.

275
00:20:12,809 --> 00:20:17,792
I'm okay. You came here because you
were worried his feelings got hurt.

276
00:20:17,792 --> 00:20:20,288
I don't want to interrupt
father and son time.

277
00:20:20,288 --> 00:20:23,926
- Then let's drink all together next time.
- Sure.

278
00:20:24,777 --> 00:20:26,294
Let's go.

279
00:20:48,333 --> 00:20:49,552
Father.

280
00:20:49,552 --> 00:20:51,343
I looked over the project proposal again.

281
00:20:51,343 --> 00:20:53,748
Wasn't I supposed to get your invested money by now?

282
00:20:53,748 --> 00:20:57,012
I think the net profit will be lower than the investment.

283
00:20:57,254 --> 00:20:58,905
Bring me a new project.

284
00:20:59,468 --> 00:21:01,691
I know you'd prefer a low cost
strategy to make a bigger profit.

285
00:21:02,634 --> 00:21:04,824
You can't be so cheap about whip-out.

286
00:21:04,824 --> 00:21:07,056
Just bring me a new project.

287
00:21:07,824 --> 00:21:10,571
Can't you just trust your own kid?

288
00:21:32,108 --> 00:21:34,054
Let's drink.

289
00:21:41,881 --> 00:21:46,297
Would you tell me what I'm
wondering about before I ask?

290
00:21:49,089 --> 00:21:53,219
She said she's breaking up with me
because she loves me. I couldn't stop her.

291
00:21:53,904 --> 00:21:56,018
Because I was worried about the same thing.

292
00:21:56,018 --> 00:21:58,667
The reason you two broke up was
because you love each other?

293
00:21:59,940 --> 00:22:01,273
It was a sense of inferiority.

294
00:22:01,273 --> 00:22:02,861
Sense of inferiority?

295
00:22:02,861 --> 00:22:04,547
What inferiority?

296
00:22:05,514 --> 00:22:09,439
I understand Hae Yoon, but what kind
of sense of inferiority do you have?

297
00:22:09,989 --> 00:22:13,796
It's so weird. I feel so small in front of her.

298
00:22:14,792 --> 00:22:20,350
I feel like I have to be a better
man and that I have to be more.

299
00:22:20,350 --> 00:22:23,197
I just feel like I should have more of something.

300
00:22:23,924 --> 00:22:26,773
But the reality is I'm just a salary
man who can't even make 30K in a year.

301
00:22:28,038 --> 00:22:31,644
I guess Hae Yoon also felt
small in front of you.

302
00:22:34,568 --> 00:22:37,171
Since when did your value become money?

303
00:22:37,485 --> 00:22:38,946
What?

304
00:22:39,811 --> 00:22:43,701
If you can make 100K in a year,
do you think you won't feel small?

305
00:22:46,675 --> 00:22:52,301
I thought you had the right values.

306
00:22:53,094 --> 00:22:59,596
I'm sad that you lost your values by facing
reality while preparing the wedding.

307
00:23:00,355 --> 00:23:03,301
- I'm sorry.
- You don't have to feel sorry for me.

308
00:23:04,235 --> 00:23:09,975
I wish you can be stronger and grow
up as you go through these times.

309
00:23:11,767 --> 00:23:16,179
It's okay to let go of yourself by
drinking after you broke up with her.

310
00:23:17,055 --> 00:23:22,177
But if you want to do it, please use me.

311
00:23:23,303 --> 00:23:25,705
Can you promise me that?

312
00:23:26,241 --> 00:23:27,969
Yeah.

313
00:25:08,933 --> 00:25:11,061
I'm sorry.

314
00:25:14,601 --> 00:25:18,348
I miss you, Ha Jung Hoon.

315
00:25:46,208 --> 00:25:50,207
I guess Hae Yoon also felt small in front of you.

316
00:25:52,911 --> 00:25:54,888
Our love lost to reality.

317
00:25:54,888 --> 00:25:59,288
Our love makes us weaker not stronger.

318
00:26:04,768 --> 00:26:10,069
I think love is forever. It's people who change, not love.

319
00:26:35,509 --> 00:26:38,482
Welcome home. Long time no see.

320
00:26:38,931 --> 00:26:40,300
What are you doing here?

321
00:26:40,300 --> 00:26:42,594
What's wrong with coming
to my daughter's house?

322
00:26:42,594 --> 00:26:44,290
Did you have dinner?
I'll make you dinner.

323
00:26:44,290 --> 00:26:46,405
You said I'm one of the
reasons for the divorce.

324
00:26:46,405 --> 00:26:48,461
I'll be nice to you from now on.

325
00:26:50,159 --> 00:26:53,073
Where are you going? I said I'd make you dinner.

326
00:26:54,384 --> 00:26:57,343
- What are you doing?
- I'm going to sleep here with Mom.

327
00:26:57,343 --> 00:27:00,029
- She's going to stay here with me for a while.
- For a while?

328
00:27:00,029 --> 00:27:02,092
Are you trying to screw me over?

329
00:27:02,092 --> 00:27:04,012
If that's how you feel,
then it's a great success.

330
00:27:05,157 --> 00:27:07,212
- Did you change it?
- Yeah.

331
00:27:07,212 --> 00:27:09,778
Are you going to sleep here with us?

332
00:27:09,778 --> 00:27:11,441
No, I'm not.

333
00:27:14,163 --> 00:27:17,132
- Why?
- You should've seen the look on his face.

334
00:27:17,132 --> 00:27:19,389
He freaked out when he saw me.

335
00:27:20,141 --> 00:27:22,745
- Thank you, Mom.
- For what?

336
00:27:22,745 --> 00:27:25,002
For being my mother.

337
00:28:05,630 --> 00:28:07,121
Where's the ramen?

338
00:28:07,121 --> 00:28:08,935
It's too late to eat that.

339
00:28:08,935 --> 00:28:11,304
- There's nothing to eat.
- Do you want me to make dinner?

340
00:28:11,833 --> 00:28:15,961
Never mind. You should be able
to make your dinner yourself.

341
00:28:17,342 --> 00:28:21,212
This is a bean sprout. This is bracken and this is...

342
00:28:21,212 --> 00:28:24,411
It's okay. I don't need your help.
I'll do it myself. You can go.

343
00:28:24,411 --> 00:28:26,889
Okay then.

344
00:28:28,070 --> 00:28:29,262
Why did she come here?

345
00:28:29,262 --> 00:28:31,697
She came to her daughter's house.
There should be a reason for that?

346
00:28:32,080 --> 00:28:34,257
- I feel uncomfortable. Tell her to leave.
- No.

347
00:28:34,257 --> 00:28:36,866
Tae Hyun likes her and she
might watch him after

348
00:28:36,867 --> 00:28:39,315
we get a divorce. He needs to get used to it.

349
00:28:39,315 --> 00:28:41,205
You think you're going to raise him?

350
00:28:41,205 --> 00:28:43,615
- Not going to happen.
- He's 7.

351
00:28:43,615 --> 00:28:45,448
He needs his mom more than his father.

352
00:28:45,448 --> 00:28:49,206
If we go see a family fact-finding officer, you
will see the officer will think the same.

353
00:28:49,206 --> 00:28:51,890
Don't think this common
opinion would work for you.

354
00:28:51,890 --> 00:28:54,012
There is always an exception.

355
00:29:01,054 --> 00:29:01,977
Your occupation?

356
00:29:01,977 --> 00:29:04,168
- I'm a doctor.
- I'm a housewife.

357
00:29:05,785 --> 00:29:07,003
Educational background?

358
00:29:07,003 --> 00:29:08,944
- PHD.
- High school graduate.

359
00:29:10,091 --> 00:29:11,992
How many times have you married?

360
00:29:11,992 --> 00:29:18,232
This is the second marriage. I met her during
the first marriage so I got a divorce.

361
00:29:21,082 --> 00:29:22,634
This is my first marriage.

362
00:29:23,187 --> 00:29:25,103
So you ruined the marriage.

363
00:29:28,135 --> 00:29:31,529
A plaintiff, Nam Do Hyun, are
you sure you want a divorce?

364
00:29:32,339 --> 00:29:33,367
Yes.

365
00:29:33,756 --> 00:29:36,272
What claim do you make?

366
00:29:37,340 --> 00:29:39,567
I want to claim the
custody and parental rights.

367
00:29:39,567 --> 00:29:42,690
So I can live with my son
as soon as possible.

368
00:29:43,314 --> 00:29:46,471
You both didn't agree on
division of property, right?

369
00:29:46,471 --> 00:29:48,890
What she wants is too much.

370
00:29:48,890 --> 00:29:51,815
She wants half of my hospital grounds
that I bought in Namyangju.

371
00:29:51,815 --> 00:29:53,431
It's like highway robbery.

372
00:29:53,431 --> 00:29:56,678
She has lived a comfortable life during
the marriage even if she had nothing.

373
00:29:56,678 --> 00:30:00,178
A comfortable life? I didn't waste the
money you gave me for living expenses.

374
00:30:00,178 --> 00:30:02,037
And I worked like a servant.

375
00:30:02,037 --> 00:30:04,180
Have you even moved your finger at home?

376
00:30:04,180 --> 00:30:07,980
I gave you 10 million won for living expenses.
You lived a comfortable life with that.

377
00:30:07,980 --> 00:30:11,149
You had much more money than when you
worked as a nurse before we got married.

378
00:30:11,149 --> 00:30:13,388
Did I use all of that money?
I used it for housing.

379
00:30:13,388 --> 00:30:15,473
Who bought that suit you are wearing now?

380
00:30:15,473 --> 00:30:18,953
So he gave you more than
100 million in a year.

381
00:30:18,953 --> 00:30:21,676
I think you did live a comfortable life.

382
00:30:23,017 --> 00:30:26,928
Mrs. Jung Hae Jin, how much money
did you make when you were a nurse?

383
00:30:27,717 --> 00:30:31,870
Just like that, she doesn't know her place.

384
00:30:55,848 --> 00:30:57,780
Ta-da

385
00:31:02,204 --> 00:31:04,130
Did you make them?

386
00:31:04,130 --> 00:31:05,981
I bought it from Ki Joong's restaurant.

387
00:31:05,981 --> 00:31:09,284
- Thank you.
- We should go together for this.

388
00:31:12,229 --> 00:31:13,724
Wedding invitation for Gong
Ki Joong and Han Chae Young.

389
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:18,320
If I think of Dong Bi, I don't
want to bless him. I'm not going.

390
00:31:18,320 --> 00:31:20,631
- Do you want to break up with me?
- I'll go.

391
00:31:21,197 --> 00:31:23,313
Why are you threatening me?

392
00:31:23,313 --> 00:31:26,338
Do you know how happy I am when you say
you don't want to break up with me?

393
00:31:26,338 --> 00:31:28,442
You're so weird. Why do
you feel happy from that?

394
00:31:28,442 --> 00:31:31,253
My heart drops when you say that.

395
00:31:31,253 --> 00:31:35,112
You fall in love with me. You do.

396
00:31:36,138 --> 00:31:38,888
I think it's time to do it.

397
00:31:38,888 --> 00:31:40,356
Do what?

398
00:31:40,356 --> 00:31:42,938
There's only one thing left between us.

399
00:31:44,531 --> 00:31:46,146
You can't come to my house at night
because of your sister, right?

400
00:31:46,146 --> 00:31:49,990
It's okay. She's staying at her
daughter's house for a while.

401
00:31:49,990 --> 00:31:53,175
Hae Yoon is not getting married
and Hae Jin is getting a divorce.

402
00:31:53,175 --> 00:31:54,734
So she doesn't have time to take care of me.

403
00:31:54,734 --> 00:31:56,967
She told me to sell the
bike but she never checks.

404
00:31:56,967 --> 00:32:00,056
I don't know why Do Hyun has to
do the lawsuit for the divorce.

405
00:32:00,405 --> 00:32:02,231
I think he still has feelings for her.

406
00:32:02,231 --> 00:32:04,435
If he doesn't love her, he would want to finish

407
00:32:04,436 --> 00:32:06,594
it as soon as possible
even if it takes money.

408
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:11,105
Let's eat.

409
00:32:13,738 --> 00:32:15,595
Here.

410
00:32:17,556 --> 00:32:21,458
The accused, Jung Hae Jin, are
you sure about the divorce?

411
00:32:21,458 --> 00:32:23,047
Yes.

412
00:32:24,909 --> 00:32:27,410
What claim do you make?

413
00:32:27,410 --> 00:32:29,916
I want custody and
parental rights for my child.

414
00:32:29,916 --> 00:32:33,419
And the rate of division of property
should be more than what he requests.

415
00:32:34,111 --> 00:32:35,737
You're a housewife.

416
00:32:35,737 --> 00:32:39,878
After he married me, his sales
for the hospital got tripled.

417
00:32:40,299 --> 00:32:42,950
I assisted him so he can focus on his work.

418
00:32:42,950 --> 00:32:45,889
If I make that much money, you should do that.

419
00:32:45,889 --> 00:32:50,043
You admitted that I was perfect as a wife.

420
00:32:50,043 --> 00:32:51,576
I don't remember.

421
00:32:53,377 --> 00:32:55,169
Oh my god.

422
00:32:55,169 --> 00:32:59,278
How could you do that?
How could you do this to me?

423
00:32:59,278 --> 00:33:03,103
Lower your voice. I think
you're getting very emotional.

424
00:33:03,103 --> 00:33:06,630
This is why I can't communicate with her.

425
00:33:06,630 --> 00:33:08,557
Can we finish this today?

426
00:33:08,557 --> 00:33:11,299
The questions that I asked
you were very simple today.

427
00:33:11,299 --> 00:33:14,421
But next time, it will be more specific.

428
00:33:14,421 --> 00:33:16,995
I'll find out the reason for the divorce.

429
00:33:25,090 --> 00:33:27,650
I think the officer wasn't very
favorable to you.

430
00:33:28,305 --> 00:33:30,587
I know. I'm not stupid.

431
00:33:31,160 --> 00:33:35,484
Now do you see the reality? Without
me, you're just a regular woman.

432
00:33:35,764 --> 00:33:41,167
Even if I give you what you want, you
don't have abilities to protect them.

433
00:33:42,080 --> 00:33:44,808
Let's just finish this. I'll give you some money.

434
00:33:45,639 --> 00:33:49,229
If you agree with that now,
I'm willing to give you more.

435
00:34:05,251 --> 00:34:06,912
Why did you come out alone?
Where's my daughter?

436
00:34:06,912 --> 00:34:09,293
- How do I know?
- You went there with her.

437
00:34:09,293 --> 00:34:12,574
She's probably crying somewhere.
She's facing reality.

438
00:34:12,574 --> 00:34:19,279
Tell her to make an agreement
with me now before she gets hurt.

439
00:34:19,279 --> 00:34:22,537
I think it went well for you today.
But don't be so triumphant.

440
00:34:22,537 --> 00:34:24,552
You never know how it's going to go next.

441
00:34:24,552 --> 00:34:25,622
Don't you think you're being cheap?

442
00:34:25,622 --> 00:34:29,655
You sued her because you can't give her
money? She assisted you for 7 years.

443
00:34:29,655 --> 00:34:32,878
You can make money.
You have abilities to make money.

444
00:34:32,878 --> 00:34:36,771
I know you hate me but because of me, you
could live with a woman like her for 7 years.

445
00:34:36,771 --> 00:34:39,032
She's very nice.

446
00:34:39,032 --> 00:34:42,155
Just give her what she wants
and be friends with each other.

447
00:34:42,155 --> 00:34:44,837
You don't know what's going to happen.
Who knows? You might live with her again.

448
00:34:44,837 --> 00:34:46,272
That's never going to happen.

449
00:34:46,272 --> 00:34:48,882
You should never use the word 'never'.

450
00:35:03,449 --> 00:35:05,314
Did you cry?

451
00:35:07,121 --> 00:35:09,424
Why did you come? I told you not to.

452
00:35:09,424 --> 00:35:12,493
It's the first investigation. I wanted to come.

453
00:35:12,493 --> 00:35:14,727
He looked happy but what's wrong with you?

454
00:35:14,727 --> 00:35:16,807
What happened there?

455
00:35:18,309 --> 00:35:20,123
Mom.

456
00:35:46,871 --> 00:35:48,371
Something's weird.

457
00:35:48,371 --> 00:35:49,507
Why?

458
00:35:49,507 --> 00:35:51,405
According to what the officer said,

459
00:35:51,405 --> 00:35:55,293
after she heard that Do Hyun finished
the first marriage because of Hae Jin,

460
00:35:55,293 --> 00:35:57,139
her attitude towards Hae Jin has changed.

461
00:35:57,636 --> 00:35:58,717
I think you're right.

462
00:35:58,717 --> 00:36:01,999
A married woman is sensitive
about her husband's affair.

463
00:36:01,999 --> 00:36:03,384
Because it doesn't sound
like other people's business.

464
00:36:03,384 --> 00:36:04,579
I'll dig up some information about her.

465
00:36:04,579 --> 00:36:07,955
You didn't tell her that you're getting a
divorce because Do Hyun cheated on you?

466
00:36:07,955 --> 00:36:09,855
She's going to ask about that next time.

467
00:36:09,855 --> 00:36:13,749
Other people get their
divorce done very easily.

468
00:36:13,749 --> 00:36:17,123
It's so important for people to
get married with the right person.

469
00:36:17,569 --> 00:36:18,844
Then what should we do next?

470
00:36:18,844 --> 00:36:21,028
We should get her favor next time.

471
00:36:22,115 --> 00:36:23,636
Don't be so sad.

472
00:36:23,636 --> 00:36:26,994
A person who smiles at
the end is the real winner.

473
00:36:26,994 --> 00:36:28,355
You're right.

474
00:36:28,833 --> 00:36:30,948
When can I go to your house for dinner?

475
00:36:32,554 --> 00:36:33,554
About that.

476
00:36:33,554 --> 00:36:35,755
Hae Yoon must be having a hard
time because of the break up.

477
00:36:36,704 --> 00:36:41,828
Let's finish this first. I'm too
busy to think about other stuff now.

478
00:36:41,828 --> 00:36:44,138
- Let's go.
- Mrs. Jung.

479
00:36:45,374 --> 00:36:47,809
I've saved more money than you think.

480
00:36:47,809 --> 00:36:50,329
Yeah, I know.

481
00:36:57,935 --> 00:37:00,531
I think he likes Hae Yoon.

482
00:37:00,531 --> 00:37:03,161
- I think so.
- You wanted him as her husband.

483
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:06,786
But he's not really good looking.

484
00:37:06,786 --> 00:37:10,408
I don't like his voice. I'd forgive
his face if he had 1000 million won.

485
00:37:11,133 --> 00:37:12,666
Mom.

486
00:37:13,302 --> 00:37:16,189
Now you're smiling. You feel better now?

487
00:37:16,189 --> 00:37:19,774
Don't make a sad face. You
still have a long way to go.

488
00:37:24,458 --> 00:37:27,361
How can people who have
no mom live in this world?

489
00:37:31,300 --> 00:37:33,644
Is this better or is that one better?

490
00:37:35,069 --> 00:37:38,223
- They look all the same.
- Dude, it's different.

491
00:37:39,548 --> 00:37:41,169
This one looks better.

492
00:37:42,909 --> 00:37:45,744
- I like this one better though.
- Then go with that one.

493
00:37:46,184 --> 00:37:48,973
Hey, can't you be serious?

494
00:37:48,973 --> 00:37:52,716
- I'm so lazy.
- I was with you when you needed me.

495
00:37:52,716 --> 00:37:55,743
So was I. Don't take the credit yourself.

496
00:37:57,070 --> 00:37:58,936
- Do you want to drink?
- No.

497
00:37:59,558 --> 00:38:02,705
I'm not going to drink and ruin myself
just because of a break up with a woman.

498
00:38:02,705 --> 00:38:06,133
That sounds so mature!

499
00:38:06,133 --> 00:38:08,176
Hey.

500
00:38:08,176 --> 00:38:10,802
Why? Did it hurt you?

501
00:38:12,567 --> 00:38:14,252
No.

502
00:38:14,912 --> 00:38:19,781
You said you watched a video about the
beautiful wedding, right? Show me that.

503
00:38:19,781 --> 00:38:22,598
- I couldn't find it.
- It's on my computer.

504
00:38:22,598 --> 00:38:26,510
I need to watch that and there
isn't any food at my house.

505
00:38:26,928 --> 00:38:32,577
- So what?
- I don't know. What do you want to do?

506
00:38:58,710 --> 00:39:01,502
- His wedding is soon.
- Yeah.

507
00:39:01,502 --> 00:39:04,007
His wedding is going at full speed.

508
00:39:04,545 --> 00:39:06,731
Whatever. I don't care.

509
00:39:07,819 --> 00:39:11,027
Don't pretend to be okay. Just
tell me if you are hurting.

510
00:39:25,302 --> 00:39:27,125
Mr. Ha.

511
00:39:30,733 --> 00:39:32,331
Were you surprised that I called?

512
00:39:32,331 --> 00:39:35,092
- No.
- I wanted to hang out with you.

513
00:39:35,092 --> 00:39:37,164
Now I can do it.

514
00:39:37,164 --> 00:39:39,578
What do you like to eat?
Let's eat what you want.

515
00:39:39,578 --> 00:39:41,645
Okay.

516
00:39:44,349 --> 00:39:48,125
- Hi, Mrs. Ha.
- Hi. Long time no see.

517
00:39:48,125 --> 00:39:52,234
- I've wanted to eat your food.
- Sure. Come eat.

518
00:39:55,095 --> 00:39:57,165
What's wrong with her? Is she mad at me?

519
00:39:57,566 --> 00:40:00,139
No.
Go to my room.

520
00:40:04,877 --> 00:40:07,586
- Are you mad at something?
- Don't be close with Dong Bi.

521
00:40:07,586 --> 00:40:08,584
Mom.

522
00:40:08,584 --> 00:40:11,648
I know you're not getting married to
Hae Yoon but I keep faith with her.

523
00:40:11,648 --> 00:40:13,720
Dong Bi hurt Hae Yoon's feeling.

524
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:15,269
I said it's not that.

525
00:40:15,269 --> 00:40:17,944
Anyway, a man and a woman
can't be friends.

526
00:40:17,944 --> 00:40:22,532
Where's the mom that I like? The mom that
understands me and listens to me.

527
00:40:22,532 --> 00:40:25,498
- I'm doing this for you.
- If it's for me, then just do nothing.

528
00:40:25,498 --> 00:40:27,805
Do you think I'm all better?
Why do you talk about Hae Yoon?

529
00:40:28,708 --> 00:40:32,172
I got dumped by a woman
because I'm incompetent.

530
00:40:32,172 --> 00:40:33,891
Why is it because you're incompetent?

531
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:37,199
What would Dad do if he were me?

532
00:40:38,095 --> 00:40:41,483
If it was him, would he have let you go?

533
00:40:59,856 --> 00:41:01,448
I heard everything.

534
00:41:01,448 --> 00:41:03,810
Sorry. My mom is sensitive lately.

535
00:41:03,810 --> 00:41:05,762
I'm going to go.

536
00:41:22,343 --> 00:41:26,063
- Are you holding ancestral rites now?
- I told you I'm not going to drink.

537
00:41:26,063 --> 00:41:30,697
I met with Hae Yoon. I tried to make her
feel better but she was so mad already.

538
00:41:32,782 --> 00:41:35,787
Seeing things is stronger
than hearing things.

539
00:41:36,424 --> 00:41:38,732
So she wouldn't believe me even
if I tell her everything.

540
00:41:38,732 --> 00:41:42,536
You should tell her until she believes you.
You're the only friend to her.

541
00:41:43,265 --> 00:41:45,234
I'm not her supporting actress anymore.

542
00:41:45,234 --> 00:41:47,751
If you're a supporting actress, does that
mean Ki Joong is my supporting actor?

543
00:41:47,751 --> 00:41:50,015
He can't be a supporting actor.

544
00:41:50,015 --> 00:41:54,573
He has a great background and he
has this loneliness on his face.

545
00:41:54,573 --> 00:41:56,302
That's what a woman really likes.

546
00:41:56,302 --> 00:41:59,495
That guy loved you. You're
a very attractive woman.

547
00:41:59,495 --> 00:42:01,129
Be confident.

548
00:42:01,129 --> 00:42:04,744
You're stupid. A woman changes
her mind very easily.

549
00:42:05,262 --> 00:42:08,634
The confidence that you get from someone
you love is like a sand castle.

550
00:42:10,346 --> 00:42:12,336
Let's drink just one shot, friend.

551
00:42:15,162 --> 00:42:17,275
Okay. Just this one.

552
00:42:39,915 --> 00:42:42,770
- What do you think?
- It's delicious.

553
00:42:43,582 --> 00:42:47,464
You could've went to a
nicer restaurant than this.

554
00:42:47,745 --> 00:42:51,107
I wanted to come to a place like this with you.

555
00:42:51,107 --> 00:42:52,400
It's very warm and friendly.

556
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:58,506
When I was young I was jealous of kids
who ate food here with their dads.

557
00:43:00,115 --> 00:43:02,446
I see.
Let's eat.

558
00:43:02,446 --> 00:43:05,308
Bring us more pickled radish.

559
00:43:08,380 --> 00:43:12,154
Let's have dessert at a place that I want to go.

560
00:43:12,154 --> 00:43:13,588
Sure.

561
00:43:22,494 --> 00:43:25,534
- What do you think?
- It's delicious.

562
00:43:25,534 --> 00:43:27,782
I come here often with my wife.

563
00:43:27,782 --> 00:43:31,549
I also liked the restaurant
where we had dinner tonight.

564
00:43:31,549 --> 00:43:33,409
Thank you.

565
00:43:35,005 --> 00:43:36,958
Hae Yoon.

566
00:43:36,958 --> 00:43:42,948
I was so happy to think that
you will become a part of our family.

567
00:43:44,709 --> 00:43:47,246
I'm not good enough to be
your daughter-in-law.

568
00:43:47,940 --> 00:43:49,913
After all these years,

569
00:43:49,913 --> 00:43:54,272
I realized the most important thing for a
marriage is how much they love each other.

570
00:43:54,979 --> 00:43:57,110
But I don't think so.

571
00:43:58,197 --> 00:44:02,546
People spend money to feel happy.

572
00:44:02,546 --> 00:44:07,845
But if you're with someone you love, happiness
comes to you even if you don't pay for it.

573
00:44:07,845 --> 00:44:10,014
It's free.

574
00:44:10,643 --> 00:44:13,128
I know there isn't anything that's free in the world.

575
00:44:13,128 --> 00:44:15,544
But love is free.

576
00:44:16,982 --> 00:44:20,424
Living a life is a series of conflicts.

577
00:44:20,812 --> 00:44:23,006
You can't just solve them as
if you are solving a math problem.

578
00:44:42,963 --> 00:44:44,709
Thank you.

579
00:44:44,709 --> 00:44:48,786
Next time, you should call me first.

580
00:44:48,786 --> 00:44:51,906
Don't be nice to me. I can't leave you.

581
00:44:51,906 --> 00:44:54,635
If you can't leave, then don't.

582
00:44:54,635 --> 00:45:00,015
Choi Mo Lyung famously said
that to Kim Ji Mi in the 70s.

583
00:45:00,800 --> 00:45:02,775
Do you know Choi Mo Lyung?

584
00:45:02,775 --> 00:45:04,460
He's the father of Choi Min Su.

585
00:45:05,270 --> 00:45:08,529
You know him.
You're not that young anymore.

586
00:45:08,529 --> 00:45:10,352
I know.

587
00:45:11,048 --> 00:45:15,989
Do you live in the 1970s
or in the year of 2012?

588
00:45:20,883 --> 00:45:22,437
Mrs. Jung.

589
00:45:25,668 --> 00:45:27,256
- Hi.
- Hi.

590
00:45:27,256 --> 00:45:29,140
What are you doing here?

591
00:45:29,140 --> 00:45:32,832
- I hung out with Hae Yoon tonight.
- I see.

592
00:45:32,832 --> 00:45:35,648
I went out to buy some snacks and drinks.

593
00:45:35,648 --> 00:45:38,177
You are having a get-together with your daughters.

594
00:45:39,123 --> 00:45:42,117
Yeah, it's a get-together with my daughters.

595
00:45:42,117 --> 00:45:46,209
You achieved my wife's dream.

596
00:45:46,209 --> 00:45:49,387
Her dream is to hang out with
her daughter if there is one.

597
00:45:50,473 --> 00:45:53,539
Why is that her dream? She can just have one.

598
00:45:54,580 --> 00:45:58,122
- It's kind of hard to have a daughter.
- I know.

599
00:45:59,010 --> 00:46:01,146
- It's cold.
- Yeah.

600
00:46:01,146 --> 00:46:03,839
- It's cold. You should go.
- Yeah, Mrs. Jung.

601
00:46:04,335 --> 00:46:08,160
- It was nice seeing you.
- It was nice seeing you too.

602
00:46:22,856 --> 00:46:24,848
What's going on?
Why did you come here with him?

603
00:46:24,848 --> 00:46:28,092
- You said you're done with Jung Hoon.
- Mom, ask me one by one.

604
00:46:28,092 --> 00:46:31,889
You need to get used to a new life.
Cross the line.

605
00:46:31,889 --> 00:46:34,288
He came to my school.

606
00:46:34,288 --> 00:46:39,036
He's a great man. If my dad was
alive, I think he'd be like Mr. Ha.

607
00:46:39,036 --> 00:46:42,544
He was very innocent.
Hae Jin got that from him.

608
00:46:42,544 --> 00:46:44,752
But you aren't because you're more like me.

609
00:46:44,752 --> 00:46:48,532
- I like Mr. Jung.
- Did you guys get back together?

610
00:46:48,532 --> 00:46:53,951
I'm done with him. I think he came to say bye.
I could've been a part of his family, you know.

611
00:46:53,951 --> 00:46:59,911
That's useless. If he came to convince
you, he should've acted more clearly.

612
00:46:59,911 --> 00:47:02,850
It's like he has no guts.

613
00:47:05,819 --> 00:47:09,986
- Can I sleep in her house too?
- Yeah. It's far to go home now.

614
00:47:09,986 --> 00:47:12,335
- How did the court thing go?
- Failed.

615
00:47:12,335 --> 00:47:14,385
I can hear everything.

616
00:47:32,676 --> 00:47:35,739
- You should come and dance with me.
- After this shot.

617
00:47:35,739 --> 00:47:37,249
Me too.

618
00:47:58,993 --> 00:48:00,396
What the heck?

619
00:48:02,414 --> 00:48:04,473
You haven't changed a bit.

620
00:48:04,473 --> 00:48:06,162
Who is this woman?

621
00:48:06,162 --> 00:48:08,940
- Why did you hit him?
- Who is she?

622
00:48:08,940 --> 00:48:11,897
- You have bad taste.
- What are you doing here?

623
00:48:12,235 --> 00:48:14,180
I came to dance.
I'm dating this man.

624
00:48:14,180 --> 00:48:17,640
You look so old now.

625
00:48:17,640 --> 00:48:20,839
You should get plastic surgery
if you want more customers.

626
00:48:20,839 --> 00:48:22,671
You still make biting remarks.

627
00:48:22,671 --> 00:48:24,820
- I heard you're getting a divorce.
- How did you know?

628
00:48:24,820 --> 00:48:27,100
- I met Hae Jin.
- Why?

629
00:48:27,100 --> 00:48:28,680
Did she ask you for something?

630
00:48:29,521 --> 00:48:33,481
The best thing I've done in my life
was getting a divorce with you.

631
00:48:33,481 --> 00:48:37,610
You're so cheap. Just give her what you want.

632
00:48:40,012 --> 00:48:45,203
You're too skinny. If you lose weight like
this, you'll suffer from osteoporosis later.

633
00:48:49,485 --> 00:48:54,240
What was that? No wonder
why you cheated on her.

634
00:48:57,734 --> 00:48:59,765
What was the good evidence that
you were talking about last time?

635
00:48:59,765 --> 00:49:02,884
Why did you marry women like them?

636
00:49:02,884 --> 00:49:06,902
Hae Jin smashed my apartment and
that woman just smashed you.

637
00:49:06,902 --> 00:49:09,894
- I don't understand.
- Let's get out.

638
00:49:14,031 --> 00:49:17,603
- I don't understand.
- Let's get out.

639
00:49:18,368 --> 00:49:21,787
He said he's going to give me money if I give up my child.

640
00:49:21,787 --> 00:49:23,579
That's why I'm getting a divorce.

641
00:49:24,101 --> 00:49:25,834
Every man for his own.

642
00:49:25,834 --> 00:49:28,321
If you don't like it, I'd just
suck it up and live with him.

643
00:49:28,893 --> 00:49:31,698
- I did a good job, didn't I?
- Good job.

644
00:49:31,698 --> 00:49:36,862
I feel so bad for you. The women
you got married to are so weird.

645
00:49:36,862 --> 00:49:39,448
They're so big and ugly.

646
00:49:39,448 --> 00:49:41,721
I'm tall but I have skinny bones.

647
00:49:42,484 --> 00:49:44,142
Go to sleep.

648
00:49:44,762 --> 00:49:46,188
Sleep here.

649
00:49:46,188 --> 00:49:48,178
I'd like to but I'm at war.

650
00:49:48,178 --> 00:49:50,545
If I don't come back home,
my mother-in-law will think she won.

651
00:49:52,167 --> 00:49:54,986
I guess there's a heater
in this bathroom.

652
00:49:54,986 --> 00:49:56,589
Yeah, isn't it warm?

653
00:49:57,711 --> 00:49:59,025
It's so nice.

654
00:49:59,025 --> 00:50:05,813
I tried so hard to make
you live well and warm.

655
00:50:05,813 --> 00:50:09,304
Mom, let's not talk about
that tonight and have fun.

656
00:50:09,548 --> 00:50:12,262
Okay, let's have fun.

657
00:50:15,617 --> 00:50:17,052
This is so nice.

658
00:50:17,052 --> 00:50:19,140
Are we all going to sleep here?

659
00:50:19,140 --> 00:50:21,354
It's big enough.

660
00:50:21,354 --> 00:50:23,236
I feel empty without Aunt Deul Rae.

661
00:50:23,236 --> 00:50:26,531
I should've told her to come.
She must feel lonely.

662
00:50:34,992 --> 00:50:37,178
No, this isn't good.

663
00:50:45,418 --> 00:50:48,327
No. I can't sleep with him.

664
00:50:55,163 --> 00:50:57,854
- Hey, sis.
- Do you want to come to Hae Jin's house?

665
00:50:57,854 --> 00:51:01,423
We are all here.
We feel empty without you.

666
00:51:01,423 --> 00:51:05,150
I'm fine.
I'm kind of tired.

667
00:51:05,150 --> 00:51:08,279
- Don't forget to lock the door.
- Okay.

668
00:51:34,009 --> 00:51:35,566
Hi.

669
00:51:44,238 --> 00:51:45,150
It's Min Deul Rae.

670
00:51:45,150 --> 00:51:46,863
It's your name.

671
00:51:48,242 --> 00:51:52,189
Didn't know you can be like this. You
got cheesy after you started dating me.

672
00:51:52,189 --> 00:51:53,405
So you don't like it?

673
00:51:53,405 --> 00:51:55,592
- I like it.
- Do you hate flowers?

674
00:51:55,592 --> 00:51:58,810
I like it. I like Min Deul Rae.
I like everything you give me.

675
00:51:58,810 --> 00:52:00,921
I like you when you do that.

676
00:52:00,921 --> 00:52:04,290
You don't play hard to get.
You like everything about me.

677
00:52:12,690 --> 00:52:16,001
It's kind of cold here.

678
00:52:16,001 --> 00:52:17,584
Can you turn on the heater?

679
00:52:17,584 --> 00:52:21,149
The gas bill is expensive.
My sister is going to freak out.

680
00:52:21,149 --> 00:52:22,994
Alright.

681
00:52:22,994 --> 00:52:25,566
Then let's increase the
temperature by our temperature.

682
00:52:25,566 --> 00:52:28,335
- I can't sleep with you tonight.
- Why?

683
00:52:28,335 --> 00:52:30,575
You don't have to know.

684
00:52:31,736 --> 00:52:34,417
- What is it?
- I'm going to lose weight.

685
00:52:34,417 --> 00:52:36,135
I can't show this body.

686
00:52:36,135 --> 00:52:37,806
It's the same in the dark.

687
00:52:37,806 --> 00:52:40,390
No. Let's just talk tonight while in this mood.

688
00:52:40,390 --> 00:52:43,323
What is it like talking in this mood?

689
00:52:43,323 --> 00:52:46,993
We can start doing it by filling the glass.

690
00:52:53,193 --> 00:52:54,928
Cheers.

691
00:53:03,380 --> 00:53:06,082
It feels so good to do a pace book,
after such a long time.

692
00:53:06,082 --> 00:53:08,657
Your skin looks so good and pale.

693
00:53:08,657 --> 00:53:10,908
I should've gotten her skin.

694
00:53:10,908 --> 00:53:12,910
I got her skin so mine is pale too.

695
00:53:12,910 --> 00:53:15,865
You should be thanking me
because you got my skin.

696
00:53:15,865 --> 00:53:17,642
Skin is very important to women.

697
00:53:17,642 --> 00:53:20,670
She's so skinny just like you.
I'm just like my dad. I'm big.

698
00:53:20,670 --> 00:53:23,438
Because of your dad, your
arms and legs are long.

699
00:53:23,438 --> 00:53:26,405
- That's your charm.
- So cheesy.

700
00:53:26,405 --> 00:53:30,759
- But I don't like your make up.
- Look at her. She's trying to teach me again.

701
00:53:30,759 --> 00:53:33,784
No, I'm not. Mom, natural-looking
make up is the trend these days.

702
00:53:33,784 --> 00:53:35,787
Who does their make up like you these days?

703
00:53:35,787 --> 00:53:37,606
You think this make up looks good on anybody?

704
00:53:37,606 --> 00:53:39,303
If you do it wrong, you
look so old-fashioned.

705
00:53:39,303 --> 00:53:43,827
But I look like an actress. People
say I look like Lee Mi Suk.

706
00:53:44,956 --> 00:53:47,444
Sis, she's so funny.

707
00:53:47,444 --> 00:53:50,176
- Why so funny?
- Because you don't make any sense.

708
00:53:50,176 --> 00:53:53,283
- Hey!
- When are we going to drink?

709
00:53:53,283 --> 00:53:54,989
Alright.

710
00:53:54,989 --> 00:54:01,946
All three of us haven't got together in so long.
Let's start our bright new days from tomorrow.

711
00:54:03,107 --> 00:54:06,876
Here's a shot for my oldest daughter.

712
00:55:12,276 --> 00:55:16,165
Wake up, Gong Ki Joong. I know you woke up
because you're sensitive when you sleep.

713
00:55:22,655 --> 00:55:25,259
- I need to talk to you.
- About what?

714
00:55:25,259 --> 00:55:27,385
About business.

715
00:55:30,367 --> 00:55:33,521
I hate to talk about business
right after I get up.

716
00:55:37,474 --> 00:55:39,147
Let's go to the living room.

717
00:55:40,742 --> 00:55:43,418
You.

718
00:55:44,156 --> 00:55:47,297
I'm going to throw you to the wind.

719
00:55:52,351 --> 00:55:55,384
Who were you with? You didn't
even tell me who you were with.

720
00:55:55,384 --> 00:55:59,619
- I was with Hae Yoon.
- Honey, are you serious?

721
00:55:59,619 --> 00:56:03,306
Their break up is a very
good chance for Jung Hoon.

722
00:56:03,306 --> 00:56:06,224
Besides, she broke up with Jung Hoon first.

723
00:56:06,224 --> 00:56:10,188
Hae Yoon is a nice woman. She
was about to become part of our family.

724
00:56:10,188 --> 00:56:13,825
Please. Don't make things worse!

725
00:56:32,400 --> 00:56:34,024
Do you remember this, Mom?

726
00:56:34,838 --> 00:56:41,483
After Dad passed away, you were in a
partnership with your friend, but she tricked you.

727
00:56:41,483 --> 00:56:47,545
She couldn't help it. She needed money desperately
so she had to run away with my money.

728
00:56:47,545 --> 00:56:50,177
Money made her do that.
She was very nice before.

729
00:56:50,177 --> 00:56:54,541
Anyway, when you were so busy finding her...

730
00:56:54,541 --> 00:56:55,470
I remember that.

731
00:56:55,470 --> 00:57:01,481
When I cried because I missed Mom, she
made me food and carried me on her back.

732
00:57:01,481 --> 00:57:05,113
After I put you to sleep, I went
to Mom's room and cried.

733
00:57:05,113 --> 00:57:08,558
I was so scared. I felt like
I was the only one in the world.

734
00:57:08,558 --> 00:57:11,652
You should've woke me up.
You were still young.

735
00:57:11,652 --> 00:57:12,871
But I'm your older sister.

736
00:57:12,871 --> 00:57:18,021
Mom said I should take good care
of you because I'm the older sister.

737
00:57:18,021 --> 00:57:19,821
It's all because of your dad.

738
00:57:20,637 --> 00:57:24,973
What was I supposed to do after he passed away?
I was a housewife before.

739
00:57:24,973 --> 00:57:27,934
He should've left me with a lot
of money before he died.

740
00:57:27,934 --> 00:57:34,380
But Mom, I feel the same thing.
I'm alone in this house.

741
00:57:36,063 --> 00:57:37,452
That evil bastard.

742
00:57:37,452 --> 00:57:43,214
That time was better than now. Because I
knew it would end when you came back home.

743
00:57:51,910 --> 00:57:54,087
Do you not see me here?

744
00:57:54,087 --> 00:57:57,627
- I'm home.
- Come here.

745
00:57:57,627 --> 00:58:02,940
- You guys have fun.
- You bastard, what have you done to her?

746
00:58:02,940 --> 00:58:04,929
I think you're drunk. Go to sleep.

747
00:58:04,929 --> 00:58:07,636
I am drunk but I don't have to go to sleep.

748
00:58:07,636 --> 00:58:09,374
- Just leave him alone.
- Yeah.

749
00:58:09,374 --> 00:58:14,874
Mrs. Jung, you should step back
for your daughters' happiness.

750
00:58:14,874 --> 00:58:17,133
You have that kind of temper
that doesn't help them at all.

751
00:58:18,464 --> 00:58:22,292
You son of a bitch, don't
talk to my mom like that.
